<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Ukraine has already risen! (Mykhailo Zazulyak)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1926</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recorded variant</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Slava Ukraini!</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2022</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new song of resistance built on the anthem's opening motif</span></li></ul></section>
